  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{9}\u27e8\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,1\u27e9\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{1}^{9}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{9}1\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9},\\,t\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\sqrt{9}-\\sqrt{1},\\,9-1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e82,\\,8\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
